      "title": "FULL SCENE BATCHES",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### START HERE - Longform Yvann workflow\nThis canvas uses the actual Yvann audio-reactive graph with a folder image-batch loader.\n1. Choose/upload the full music mix in Load Audio.\n2. Paste/edit the cue sheet in Cue Sheet Textbox + Parser.\n3. Queue the launcher.\nEach timestamp range generates a scene folder with one varied image every image_interval_seconds. The KJ folder loader feeds the full folder batch to Yvann; no fixed four-image limit is used."
      ]
    },
