      "title": "WHAT YOU SEE",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### What this workflow outputs\nCue Sheet Parser: parsed batches and timestamp split plan.\nBatch Status: latest job progress, chunks, generated image filenames, thumbnails.\nGenerated Batch Images Output: actual IMAGE output socket containing generated batch images from the latest job.\nUse batch_or_chunk_filter like A or chunk_0001 to inspect only one batch/chunk."
