      "title": "HOW IT CONNECTS TO YVANN",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### How generated images reach Yvann\nGenerated Batch Images Output is the visible preview/output socket.\nThe Actual Yvann Render Engine inspector shows the real Yvann workflow file and nodes.\nQUEUE THIS reads yvann_workflow_path, generates images for each chunk, copies them to ComfyUI input, replaces Yvann LoadImage nodes with those files, replaces LoadAudio with the chunk audio, then queues Yvann output node 410."
      ]
